# StrictFlagsPerStage: a stage diverts only under its own per-tree flag.
# The flag is honoured twice: OnWriteCoreAsync trusts a non-strict system-origin
# write before validating it (#5718), and ViolationAsync re-checks it before
# dead-lettering. Either alone masks the other, so the fault drops both.
